
  Agent box - claude | pi | hermes
  --------------------------------
  agents        pick an agent, launch it inside tmux (survives disconnects)
  claude pi hermes
                run one directly (first claude run: /login or CLAUDE_CODE_OAUTH_TOKEN)
  cl            claude inside tmux session 'claude' (resume: tmux attach -t claude)
  gh auth login Authenticate GitHub CLI for pushes/PRs
  ~/            persisted on the volume: repos, auth and dotfiles survive redeploys


